	"talks": [
		{
			"id": 7601414,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7608201",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7608201,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Maite"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760141401,
					"content": "#What is it, {M#brother}{F#sister}? Is there anything else you want to ask?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141402,
						760141406,
						760141409,
						760141413,
						760141426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141402,
					"content": "About that crab...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141403
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760141403,
					"content": "*sigh* It looks scary, but it's always been gentle. It'll probably return to normal now that the stone's gone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141404,
					"content": "But for now, let's leave it to hide away and reflect on its actions. Manipulated or not, what's done is done, and it still hurt all those little crabs.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141405,
					"content": "Just like that bad governor who went up against Reed Miller while under the mirror's spell — excuses don't change the fact that you have to right wrongs with action.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141406,
					"content": "Tell me about that strange stone...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760141407,
					"content": "Hehe, that's the st{RUBY#[D]Twardowska's Stone}one of desire, an item that can manipulate human hearts... Hmm, at least I think that's the name Big Sis Hidimbi mentioned?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141408,
					"content": "*ahem* A—Anyway, it's something that fell out of the skies, like that giant rock over where the Frostmoon Scions live. Since it flew away, we should be safe now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141409,
					"content": "Tell me about the Conch Gang...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141410
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760141410,
					"content": "#Hmm? You wanna learn about us, {M#brother}{F#sister}? Sure. You're already a friend of ours, anyway.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141411,
					"content": "We're like a... Hmm, a mutual aid and coordination organization for like-minded people of similar age. It's a shame that you're too old to join us, but...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141412,
					"content": "If you should ever need help with anything in Nasha Town while I'm around and able, just call on me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141413,
					"content": "About that odd person from before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141414
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760141414,
					"content": "Oh, you mean that purple-haired priestess. She hasn't made a move against us yet, so at least she's not our enemy — for now. We should try to stay out of her business as much as possible, though.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141415,
					"content": "Curiosity can prove deadly. Big Sis Katya also warned against making contact with those Frostmoon weirdos, and for good reason — even a master thief like myself was almost caught and sacrificed to their Moon Goddess once.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141416,
					"content": "Sacrificed!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141417
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760141417,
					"content": "Yeah, those folks are really creepy. I've heard that they take blood from different people and... Ugh, just thinking about it gives me the chills. Let's leave it at that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141418,
					"content": "Fortunately, the one who caught me was just a naive little girl. She agreed to let me go after I told her a few stories. Otherwise...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141419,
					"content": "I—I wasn't scared, really. A master thief never gets scared! Just a word of advice for you, though — stay away from them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141420,
					"content": "Ah, right, I almost forgot about the informant I promised you details about earlier. All that I learned about the Frostmoon Scions, I got from Big Sis Hidimbi.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141421,
					"content": "If you wanna find her... Well, I think she's still around Nasha Town. Ask around and you should find out.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141422,
						760141424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141422,
					"content": "She'll be taking a long break, I think...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141423
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760141423,
					"content": "Hmm? So you've met her already? I never heard her mention taking time off... Ah well, that can wait.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141424,
					"content": "Doesn't sound all that reliable...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760141425,
					"content": "Oh, don't worry. She's super reliable. Trust in Maite, and set your worries aside!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				},
				{
					"id": 760141426,
					"content": "See you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760141427
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760141427,
					"content": "Alright. Safe travels, buddy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Maite"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7601417,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7608202
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
